---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Why most videos don't work — and how Attention Earned fixes that."
>
  <article class="about-article container">
    <h1>Your video looks great. So why isn't it working?</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      You spent $10K on a video. It's beautifully shot. The lighting is perfect.
      The color grade is gorgeous. And... nothing. 47 views. No leads. No
      conversions. Just sitting there, expensive and useless.
    </p>

    <div class="questions">
      <div class="question">
        <div class="question__num">01</div>
        <h3>Who's actually watching?</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="question">
        <div class="question__num">02</div>
        <h3>What do they need to hear to take action?</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="question">
        <div class="question__num">03</div>
        <h3>Where is this going to live?</h3>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>What changes when you get this right</h2>
    <div class="outcome-grid">
      <div class="outcome-card"><p>Fundraising video raises money.</p></div>
      <div class="outcome-card"><p>Paid ads convert.</p></div>
      <div class="outcome-card"><p>Founder story positions.</p></div>
      <div class="outcome-card"><p>Product video drives action.</p></div>
    </div>

    <blockquote>
      "The difference between a video that works and one that doesn't isn't
      production quality. It's whether you said the right thing to the right people."
    </blockquote>

    <h2>How this works</h2>
    <ol class="process-list">
      <li><span class="process-list__num">01</span><span>Figure out what to say.</span></li>
      <li><span class="process-list__num">02</span><span>Make it work for the platform.</span></li>
      <li><span class="process-list__num">03</span><span>Execute it right.</span></li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Who this is for</h2>
    <div class="audience-badges">
      <span class="ae-badge ae-badge--outline">B2B / Startups</span>
      <span class="ae-badge ae-badge--outline">Founders raising capital</span>
      <span class="ae-badge ae-badge--outline">Nonprofits</span>
      <span class="ae-badge ae-badge--outline">Companies running paid campaigns</span>
    </div>

    <h2>Why this is different</h2>
    <p>Most producers are order-takers. I push back. I think campaigns. No agency overhead.</p>

    <h2>Quick credibility check</h2>
    <p>Grew up around nonprofits. Went from 15-second social ads to 70-interview documentaries. Real film set and marketing experience.</p>

    <div class="about-cta">
      <h2>Let's figure out what you actually need</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary btn-lg">Start the conversation</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <CtaBand
    heading="Now you know how I think."
    accentPhrase="Let's see if it's a fit."
    primaryLabel="Start the conversation"
    primaryHref="/contact"
  />
</Base>

<style>
  .about-article {
    max-width: var(--container-text);
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem) 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .about-article h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: var(--lh-tight);
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .about-article h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .about-article h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  .about-article p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  /* Questions */
  .questions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }

  .question {}

  .question__num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Outcome grid */
  .outcome-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) { .outcome-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .outcome-card {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .outcome-card p {
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Blockquote */
  blockquote {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Process list */
  .process-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .process-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  .process-list__num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    font-size: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Audience badges */
  .audience-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.625rem;
  }

  .ae-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  }

  .ae-badge--outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-mid);
  }

  /* Bottom CTA within article */
  .about-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-cta h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0; }

  /* Buttons */
  .btn-primary, .btn-lg {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out), box-shadow var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .btn-lg { font-size: var(--fs-body); padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem; }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--grad-cta);
    color: var(--text-on-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--glow-cta);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 50px -8px rgba(252,44,48,0.7), 0 0 0 1px rgba(252,44,48,0.4);
  }
</style>
